  "ingredients": [
    "1 (12 pound) whole turkey, neck and giblets removed",
    "3 cups water",
    "2 cups cold butter, cut into pieces",
    "2 tablespoons seasoned salt (such as LAWRY'S®)",
    "1 tablespoon ground black pepper",
    "2 cubes chicken bouillon granules"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QfwMxvQXxmnmRjrGcqvJpvyxsQ4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258726-gas-grill-turkey-05-3f8c18248b6a41e19efb37b83e49f645.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258726/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an outdoor grill to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Place turkey into a roasting pan with the breast facing up.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8SXycui-xIo5QhUyHnIdDlmHdp8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258726-gas-grill-turkey-06-58ed2d8030e14c13961d43ef7cf2b62a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258726/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring water to a boil in a large pot. Stir in butter, seasoned salt, pepper, and bouillon cubes until butter melts and bouillon dissolves.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cBcKmnycJJF8aAgOftQenOYvqJU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258726-gas-grill-turkey-07-9624a1b4d85a416c8dc36670c2635568.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258726/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Draw 30 milliliters liquid into a marinade injector; inject all over turkey. Pour remaining liquid into the bottom of the roasting pan. Cover the pan with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oeCynivrApIwQ0-gJkwzf5kJE74=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258726-gas-grill-turkey-08-5d13ec27b59c4221968bc132481a9061.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258726/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake on the preheated grill, basting every 30 minutes, until no longer pink at the bone and the juices run clear, about 3 1/2 hours. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the thigh should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FTb4kxmeBNEZ9uLJ_dSOzDHTtM4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258726-gas-grill-turkey-09-2c5797d24e1447568f0336e81e74ef26.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258726/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove turkey from the grill, cover, and let rest in a warm area for 10 to 15 minutes before slicing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YVpuMCBf6zz2tPzK4DEsV3pTBA4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258726-gas-grill-turkey-vat-01-4x3-409976047f224d5b90e61fa30c36a580.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258726/step_06.webp"
    }
